    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Each share of Preferred Stock will automatically convert on the third anniversary of the issue date into a number of shares of Class A Common Stock equal to 46.441271 shares of Class A Common Stock per share of Preferred Stock, subject to adjustment.</footnote>
